Elkulator patch 05: quit with ESC or a gamepad button combination
ESC on the PC keyboard quits (the Electron's ESCAPE is remapped to F1 in
elk.cfg). ESC used to close the F11 menu does not quit.
  elk.cfg  joy_quit_buttons = 10,11   buttons held together to quit
                                      (8BitDo M30: Select + Start)
Settings are saved on exit as usual.

